<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia-Egypt sign cooperation accords.</title>
<headline>Tunisia-Egypt sign cooperation accords.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian Prime Minister Hamed Karoui and his Egyptian counterpart Kamal Ganzouri on Sunday signed agreements on boosting cooperation in different sectors. the official TAP news agency said.</p>
<p>The accords cover finance, tourism, electricity, energy, trade exchanges, culture, youth, childhood, infrastructure, housing, communication and transport, the agency said without giving other details.</p>
<p>They were signed at the end of the fifth meeting of the Tunisian-Egyptian high commission which started in Tunis last Friday.</p>
